# AIF Code Review

Review the diff before finalizing.

Prioritize:

- Bugs and behavioral regressions.
- Data loss or privacy leaks.
- Security boundary changes.
- Missing tests for changed behavior.
- Stale docs.

Keep findings concrete and line-referenced.
